  "label": "racial slur 'nagger'",
  "description": "The term 'nagger' is a derogatory racial slur historically used against Black people, particularly in the United States. It is not a neutral or descriptive term but a hateful epithet rooted in anti-Black racism. Its use in the meme directly targets the subject, Nelly, based on his race, and is intended to demean and insult him. This slur is part of a broader history of racial epithets used to dehumanize Black individuals.",
